**Test the threshold boundary**

No assertion pins the 100 threshold. Add checks at the boundary and immediately below it:
```js
test('subtracts 5 at a total of 100', () => {
  assert.equal(applyDiscount({ items: [{ price: 100, qty: 1 }] }), 95);
});

test('does not subtract 5 below 100', () => {
  assert.equal(applyDiscount({ items: [{ price: 99, qty: 1 }] }), 99);
});
```

<details><summary>Why this was flagged</summary>

kind: missing_test, confidence: high
</details>

